nts":4,"created_at":"2025-05-26T13:03:46Z","updated_at":"2025-05-27T14:50:43Z","closed_at":"2025-05-27T14:50:38Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nv4.5.dev..master\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 10 DirectX\n\n### Issue description\n\nRelease templates using DirectX have a change to corrupt their heap during start. \nReason is this  pull request from two weeks ago #106400. \nIt seems like the new \"DCOMP_ENABLED\" macro is only defined if using the struct from within the d3d12 module but not outside of it. \n\nThis crashes because in [display_server_windows.cpp:6978](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/45fc515ae3574e9c1f9deacaa6960dec68a7d38b/platform/windows/display_server_windows.cpp#L6978) : \n````\nrendering_context = memnew(RenderingContextDriverD3D12);\n````\nthen allocates RenderingContextDriverD3D12 with the wrong size 8 bytes to small.\n\nSubsequent DirectX calls then corrupt the heap leading to crashes in random function calls.\n\nNot sure if the appropriate fix is to enable the macro everywhere or patch the RenderingContextDriverD3D12 class to always be of the same size ? \nAnyway this is blocking and Godot will crash ~50% of the time a release template is opened.\n\n\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nCreate a release template & run it with --rendering-driver d3d12\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nAn empty project will suffice","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106826/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106826/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}